      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "HO1 was triggered by the patient’s fear, bruising concerns, and family pressure. The doctor repeatedly used stabilizing, non-blaming, concrete language and linked it to inpatient monitoring and red-flag actions, improving adherence and anxiety management.",
