      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "HO2 was triggered by family pressure, fear of admission/C-section, and difficulty capturing medical details. The doctor provided executable pathways, family-facing risk wording, and structured questions for the ward team, which helped the patient remain hospitalized and stop self-managing medications.",
