          "quote": "“异常但没变坏”并不等于“安全”"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00313",
          "explanation": "The doctor clarified that not operating immediately does not mean discharge-level safety.",
          "quote": "还没达到必须立刻手术的临界点"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "HO3 was triggered by misunderstanding of fetal blood-flow and fetal-monitoring terms. The doctor corrected the patient/family’s interpretation of abnormal but stable findings and translated the concept into continued inpatient monitoring plus urgent escalation thresholds.",
      "ho_id": "HO3",
      "meaningful_trajectory_impact": true,
      "triggered": true
    },
    {
